+# code-後端情境出題 r2 收貨與處置
+
+- 材料:r2-snapshot.patch(d919fadf..112ad15f 完整差異),分區材料 r2-甲/乙-full、r2-甲/乙/丙-repair,修補鏡頭 r2-repair.patch、r2-repair-review.patch、r2-repair-binding.json、r2-behavior-cases.json。
