 {codes}  p50 {lat[len(lat)//2]:.1f}ms p99 {lat[int(len(lat)*.99)]:.1f}ms max {lat[-1]:.0f}ms\")\nprint(\"product\", call(\"GET\",f\"/products/{pid}\")[1].decode())\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/load/load.py 300 20; python3 /tmp/load/load.py 600 20"
